      "description": "❤Guarding every baby's healthy and happy growth❤\nYour baby is lucky to have parents who are willing to buy him everything he needs.👶\nI hope that the baby can grow up quickly and can be filial and protect their parents.👨‍👩‍👧‍👦🌈\nHave a nice day !!!\n\n-------------- ✨ Product Details--------------\nGuarding the healthy and happy growth of every baby\nYour baby is very lucky to have parents willing to buy him everything he needs.\nI hope that children can grow up quickly, be filial and protect their parents.      ‍‍‍\nWishing you a wonderful day!!!\n\nFeatures:\n⭐️Safety and support: the design of the saddle can firmly support the baby's spine and ensure that the posture is correct and upright during exercise.      The baby will have fun while developing coordination, strengthening muscles and improving balance.\n⭐️If the baby wants to stand up and jump, give the baby complete freedom of movement and promote relaxed and natural breathing.      Suitable for children weighing no more than 16 kg / 35 lbs.\n⭐️Adjustable design of door jump seat: adjustable shoulder straps allow you to adjust according to your baby's changing height and weight.      Slide the adjusting buckle to make it easy for the baby to wear.\n⭐️Suitable for outdoor use: it is very suitable for your baby to stand outside or practice walking alone while basking in the sun.\n⭐️Cultivate your baby's motor skills: help to develop children's coordination and rhythm, strengthen muscles and improve balance.\n\nNotes:\n1.      Clamp must be placed in centre of door.\n2.      The clamp is designed to be used on an interior doorway that is about 2M high,the wall must be Min 10cm-Max 30cm thick.     The doorway must have firmly attached trim with a flat part on the top of the trim at least 13mm wide.\n3.      Inspect architrave to ensure it is properly secure and will take the weight of a child.\n4.      Do not use where there is a glass panel above architrave.\n5.      Due to the lighting effects and shooting angles, there is color difference in the product, please understand.\n6.      Due to manual measurement, there is a tolerance in the product size.\n\nSpecification:\nName: Children Jumping Chair\nMaterial: Metal + Cotton\nWeight: 1100g\nColor: Pink, Blue\nLoad-Bearing Capacity: 30kg\nApplicable Occasions: Fitness Equipment / Swing Accessories\n\nPackage Contents :\n1 X Children Jumping Chair",
