    "product_description": {
      "paragraph_list": [
        {
          "text": "❤Guarding every baby's healthy and happy growth❤",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Your baby is lucky to have parents who are willing to buy him everything he needs.👶",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "I hope that the baby can grow up quickly and can be filial and protect their parents.👨‍👩‍👧‍👦🌈",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Have a nice day !!!",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "-------------- ✨ Product Details--------------",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Guarding the healthy and happy growth of every baby",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Your baby is very lucky to have parents willing to buy him everything he needs.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "I hope that children can grow up quickly, be filial and protect their parents.      ‍‍‍",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Wishing you a wonderful day!!!",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Features:",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "⭐️Safety and support: the design of the saddle can firmly support the baby's spine and ensure that the posture is correct and upright during exercise.      The baby will have fun while developing coordination, strengthening muscles and improving balance.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "⭐️If the baby wants to stand up and jump, give the baby complete freedom of movement and promote relaxed and natural breathing.      Suitable for children weighing no more than 16 kg / 35 lbs.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "⭐️Adjustable design of door jump seat: adjustable shoulder straps allow you to adjust according to your baby's changing height and weight.      Slide the adjusting buckle to make it easy for the baby to wear.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
